WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.170
-It was revealed that
famous Hollywood producer

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.938
Harvey Weinstein has been
sexually harassing women

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:07.840
and then paying them
to keep quiet about it.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.976
And as stunning
as the allegations are,

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.779
equally stunning was the apology
that Weinstein issued

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.447
after the article was published.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.948
Here to comment
are three of our writers,

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.183
Amber, Ally, and Jenny,
everyone.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.185
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:23.056
-Hey, thank you for having us.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:26.626
Seth, how did you feel
when you heard the allegations?

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.529
-I was disgusted and shocked.
How did you feel?

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.398
-Well, I was disgusted
and<i> not</i> shocked.

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:33.833
-I was disgusted and shocked

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.002
that it took this long
to become a story.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.305
-I was disgusted and shocked
that people were shocked.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.340
[ Laughter ]
Seth, we want to start

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.876
by applauding the women
who went on the record

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:46.479
to detail Harvey Weinstein's
terrible behavior.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.415
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:52.852
-So far we know Weinstein
reached cash settlements

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.120
with eight women.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.922
And where there are eight,
there are always more.

00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:58.524
-And whatever details you hear,

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.694
just know that means there are
worse details we haven't heard.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.530
-And the ones we<i> have</i> heard
are terrible.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.633
One woman said Harvey Weinstein
cornered her in a nightclub,

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:09.535
and then,
when she wouldn't kiss him,

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:12.405
masturbated into a potted plant.
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:16.376
-And then the plant
got a three-picture deal.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:17.876
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.876 --> 00:01:19.278
-Also in his apology,

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:23.016
he blamed disrespect of women on
growing up in the '60s and '70s,

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.451
which would be a good excuse

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.753
if he came to the present
via time machine.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.821
-Yeah, did he not notice
things have been changing

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:30.189
over the past 50 years?

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:33.193
-Does he lose his [bleep]
every time he sees a microwave?

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.995
"That man just made popcorn
without a flame!"

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.296
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:38.664
-To make matters worse,

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.633
he said he was going to
go after the NRA and Trump,

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:45.104
as if our shared politics
makes his sexual assault okay.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:48.007
-Hey, I saw a guy masturbate
into a plant.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.275
-Oh, no!
-Oh, no!

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.576
-But it was okay

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:52.711
because he was wearing
a Planned Parenthood button.

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:55.482
-Cool!
-Oh, he's a feminist! Cool.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:57.416
-When he got busted,
Weinstein said,

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:58.685
"To make up for it,

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:01.654
I'm starting a scholarship
for women directors."

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.190
That's just him
being around more women.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.726
That's not the solution,
that's the problem.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:08.894
[ Laughter ]
That's like Jared from Subway

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.030
saying, "I know I messed up,
but don't worry,

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.733
I'm starting a tee ball league."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:17.337
-You know who else is sexually
harassing women every day?

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.171
Unpowerful men like bus drivers.

00:02:19.171 --> 00:02:20.906
-And hot dog vendors.

00:02:20.906 --> 00:02:23.209
And improv coaches.
-And improv coaches.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.410
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.846
-Every woman
in the American workforce

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.781
has been harassed at some point,

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.449
-Whether
it's physical harassment

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:32.184
or a passing
inappropriate comment,

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:34.087
this is something
women deal with every day.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:37.356
-Which is why, while we weren't
shocked by Weinstein's actions,

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:39.692
the women on our staff
had some pretty strong reactions

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.793
to his apology.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:41.861
Take a look.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.797
-"I came of age
in the '60s and '70s

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.433
when all the rules about
behavior in workplaces

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.401
were different"?

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.802
[ Spitting ]

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.738
-"I so respect all women"?

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.607
[ Sigh ]

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:58.845
-"I've decided I'm going to give
the NRA my full attention."

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.549
[ Breaking glass ]

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:05.084
[ Yelling ]

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.953
-He compared himself to Jay-Z?

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:11.157
[ Spitting ]

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:13.425
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.425 --> 00:03:16.095
[ Pop! ]

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:18.131
[ Shattering ]

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:25.638
-He said
that was the culture then.

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.272
[ Spitting ]

00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:28.841
-He said
that was the culture then.

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:30.343
[ Spitting ]

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:31.811
-Don't drink that.

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:34.313
He said
it was the culture back then.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:35.982
[ Spitting ]

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:38.283
[ Light laughter ]
-Sorry.

00:03:38.283 --> 00:03:40.819
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:40.819 --> 00:03:43.656
-Obviously that was awful,

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:47.192
but harassment's clearly
a huge problem in our society.

00:03:47.192 --> 00:03:49.395
Do you guys have any thoughts
on how to change that?

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.097
-Yeah,
sexual harassment training.

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.866
-Yeah, believing women when they
come forward with complaints.

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.369
-Also, men could just
stop being such [bleep] creeps.

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.970
-Oh!
-That! Do that!

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.538
That is a great idea.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.538 --> 00:04:03.142
-You should write down.
Someone should write that down.

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.477
And you know, the worst part is

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:06.478
nothing's going to happen
to Harvey Weinstein.

00:04:06.478 --> 00:04:08.347
As shocking
as these allegations are,

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:09.748
the real shocking thing

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:12.118
would be if there were any
repercussions for his actions.

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.587
-Oh, well, actually, guys,
it was just announced yesterday

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.289
by the board of
the Weinstein Company

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.957
that he has been fired.

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:19.124
[ Spitting ]

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:20.593
[ Laughter ]
-That's amazing.

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.495
-I am shocked. Fully shocked.
-Shocking in the best way.

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:24.796
-Amber, Ally, and Jenny,
everyone!

00:04:24.796 --> 00:04:26.566
We'll be right back with more
with Senator Cory Booker!

